{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "One summer night in Rome,",
   "start": 0.09,
   "end": 1.5
  },
  {
   "text": "neighbours heard crying,",
   "start": 1.81,
   "end": 3.01
  },
  {
   "text": "and called the police.",
   "start": 3.17,
   "end": 4.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Four officers rushed over,",
   "start": 4.7,
   "end": 6.3
  },
  {
   "text": "ready for anything.",
   "start": 6.47,
   "end": 7.51
  },
  {
   "text": "No burglar.",
   "start": 8.15,
   "end": 8.92
  },
  {
   "text": "No scam.",
   "start": 9.22,
   "end": 9.92
  },
  {
   "text": "No crime at all.",
   "start": 10.38,
   "end": 11.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Just Michele,",
   "start": 11.86,
   "end": 12.64
  },
  {
   "text": "ninety-four,",
   "start": 12.9,
   "end": 13.72
  },
  {
   "text": "and his wife, Jole.",
   "start": 13.89,
   "end": 15.03
  },
  {
   "text": "Married almost seventy years.",
   "start": 15.58,
   "end": 17.4
  },
  {
   "text": "They had been watching the evening news.",
   "start": 17.98,
   "end": 19.58
  },
  {
   "text": "So much bad news,",
   "start": 19.95,
   "end": 21.151
  },
  {
   "text": "it made them cry.",
   "start": 21.151,
   "end": 22.13
  },
  {
   "text": "It was August.",
   "start": 22.91,
   "end": 23.74
  },
  {
   "text": "The neighbours were away.",
   "start": 24.11,
   "end": 25.11
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody had visited in a long time.",
   "start": 25.66,
   "end": 27.78
  },
  {
   "text": "On the table:",
   "start": 28.27,
   "end": 28.87
  },
  {
   "text": "a few grapes.",
   "start": 29.23,
   "end": 29.96
  },
  {
   "text": "So one officer cooked them spaghetti.",
   "start": 30.47,
   "end": 32.44
  },
  {
   "text": "Butter.",
   "start": 32.92,
   "end": 33.33
  },
  {
   "text": "Parmesan.",
   "start": 33.54,
   "end": 34.17
  },
  {
   "text": "The other three pulled up chairs,",
   "start": 34.68,
   "end": 36.14
  },
  {
   "text": "and just talked with them.",
   "start": 36.2,
   "end": 37.33
  },
  {
   "text": "The police wrote:",
   "start": 37.95,
   "end": 38.69
  },
  {
   "text": "there was no one to save.",
   "start": 39.11,
   "end": 40.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Only two lonely souls to reassure.",
   "start": 40.88,
   "end": 43.11
  },
  {
   "text": "That summer,",
   "start": 43.78,
   "end": 44.39
  },
  {
   "text": "their slogan was:",
   "start": 44.58,
   "end": 45.47
  },
  {
   "text": "we're always there.",
   "start": 45.83,
   "end": 46.92
  },
  {
   "text": "Not everyone has four officers and a pot of pasta.",
   "start": 47.68,
   "end": 50.37
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 50.9,
   "end": 52.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny is always there,",
   "start": 52.83,
   "end": 54.29
  },
  {
   "text": "to listen,",
   "start": 54.63,
   "end": 55.21
  },
  {
   "text": "to talk,",
   "start": 55.44,
   "end": 55.95
  },
  {
   "text": "day or night.",
   "start": 56.24,
   "end": 57.17
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 57.69,
   "end": 59.26
  }
 ]
}